Package: IEGactivity
Title: Immediate Early Gene Activity Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("kathryn-leatherbury", , , "kleatherbury3@gatech.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for immediate early gene analyses in single-cell
    multi-omics workflows. Computes per-nucleus scores from Seurat expression
    and count data, with optional variance-based gene weighting within cell
    types and user-specified groups.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    SeuratObject (>= 5.0.0),
    stats,
    utils
URL: https://github.com/kathryn-leatherbury/IEGactivity
BugReports: https://github.com/kathryn-leatherbury/IEGactivity/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
